    {
      "text": "Table “DA. 4.10 – TB cohort indicators” for 2015–2019: TB cases notified per 100 000 population were 178, 168, 165, 156 and 170, and the TB treatment success rate was 70%, 67%, 73% and 59% for 2015–2018 (blank for 2019).",
